---
// "While you slept" — a dream-journal entry. Shows Moko has a life when you're
// not looking: overnight it consolidates the day (reconciles duplicate people,
// tidies facts, lets old worries soften) and leaves an auditable note of what
// it did and what it now wonders about. Static card; a gentle shimmer on the moon.
---

<div class="dj">
  <div class="dj-head">
    <span class="dj-moon" aria-hidden="true">🌙</span>
    <span class="dj-title">Dream journal</span>
    <span class="dj-date">last night · 03:12</span>
  </div>

  <p class="dj-intro">While you slept, I tidied my mind:</p>
  <ul class="dj-list">
    <li>Merged the two “Maya”s into one — your sister is finally a single person to me.</li>
    <li>Filed 14 new things from today into the graph, each with where it came from.</li>
    <li>Let an old worry about your move soften. You seem settled now.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="dj-wonder">
    <span class="dj-flower" aria-hidden="true">🌷</span>
    <p>Now I'm wondering whether you've heard back about the apartment. I'll ask if it comes up.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="dj-foot">My inner life is private by default — but it's always yours to look in on.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .dj {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--lavender-soft) 0%, var(--card) 22%);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    padding: 24px 28px 22px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--lavender);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .dj-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .dj-moon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    animation: dj-glow 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .dj-title {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .dj-date {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .dj-intro { margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }

  .dj-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .dj-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 26px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .dj-list li::before {
    content: "✦";
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--moko-pink);
  }

  .dj-wonder {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--moko-pink-mist);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .dj-wonder p { margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.96rem; }
  .dj-flower { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.4; }

  .dj-foot {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @keyframes dj-glow {
    0%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0 transparent); transform: rotate(0deg); }
    50% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px var(--sun)); transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .dj-moon { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
